flowchart TB
  EXP[Expert] --> UX[Anveshan Experience Layer]
  LRN[Learner] --> UX
  COM[Community / Organization] --> UX
  UX --> ORCH[Deterministic orchestration<br/>workflow state • permissions • audit]
  ORCH --> AI

  subgraph AI[AI responsibilities — logical, not necessarily separate services]
    K[Knowledge<br/>Understand • Extract • Structure • Retrieve]
    E[Evidence<br/>Ground • Cite • Verify • Expose uncertainty]
    T[Transmission<br/>Teach • Practice • Evaluate • Feedback]
  end
  K <--> E
  E <--> T
  T <--> K
  AI --> KNOW
  AI --> EV
  AI --> EVAL
  AI --> LIN

  subgraph DATA[Data & provenance boundary]
    KNOW[(Knowledge store<br/>skills • practices • claims • lessons)]
    EV[(Evidence store<br/>recordings • timestamps • artifacts)]
    EVAL[(Evaluation store<br/>rubrics • observations • metrics)]
    LIN[(Audit & lineage<br/>source → interpretation → transmission)]
  end
  KNOW --> RET[Semantic retrieval / knowledge graph]
  EV --> RET
  RET --> E
  EVAL --> T
  LIN --> T

  subgraph GCP[Indicative Google Cloud delivery]
    GEM[Gemini<br/>multimodal understanding + reasoning]
    ADK[Google ADK<br/>agent orchestration where justified]
    RUN[Cloud Run<br/>prototype services]
    STR[Cloud Storage<br/>source media + artifacts]
    SEC[Security / auth / observability]
  end
  GEM --> AI
  ADK --> AI
  RUN --> ORCH
  STR --> EV
  SEC --> ORCH

  subgraph KO[Knowledge object — source + derived state]
    SK[Skill]
    CTX[Context]
    PROC[Procedure / cues / exceptions]
    CL[Claim]
    REF[Source reference<br/>ID • timestamp • speaker • modality]
    UNC[Uncertainty / review state]
    LG[Lineage / version / variant]
    SK --> PROC
    CTX --> PROC
    PROC --> CL
    CL --> REF
    CL --> UNC
    CL --> LG
  end
  KNOW --> KO
  EV --> REF
  LIN --> LG

  subgraph ROADMAP[Development path]
    M0[M0 Validate capability<br/>1 expert • 1 learner • 1 skill]
    M1[M1 Build vertical slice<br/>capture → teach → practice → verify]
    M2[M2 Test & iterate<br/>baseline → retry → measured improvement]
    M3[M3 Harden + demo<br/>replay • evidence • reliability • submission]
    M0 --> M1 --> M2 --> M3
  end
  M0 --> ORCH
  M1 --> AI
  M2 --> EVAL
  M3 --> RUN

  V[Long-term vision<br/>Memory → Expertise → Capability<br/>CAPTURE → UNDERSTAND → GROUND → TRANSMIT → PRACTICE → VERIFY → EVOLVE]
  V --> UX

